\deftab720
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs24 \cf0 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 They are there to protect the Holy Momma and the One After the One from everybody\'97including, if necessary, the people currently protecting her.
\f1\b0 \
That makes the musical subversion of Shakti security developmentally consistent rather than contradictory.\
The live manuscript has already established exactly this kind of Elvi protection. After an attack on Sarah, the High Elvis insists that Elvi protect her 
\f0\b wherever she goes, including Sublime Point
\f1\b0 . Elsewhere, the GI Blues guards physically restrain Chanta in Sarah's own residence because, in their judgement, he is a threat to the Holy Momma. When Sarah says he is her friend, their answer is essentially: 
\f2\i friends can live elsewhere, for your protection
\f1\i0 . They already regard 
\f0\b their duty to protect Sarah as superior to Sarah's own preferences
\f1\b0 .\
That is the behaviour to extend into the finale.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

